@startuml
title EduCore C4 L2 - Container View v2
left to right direction
actor "Browser" as Browser
rectangle "Gateway / Auth\nOIDC/SAML, rate limit" as Gateway
rectangle "Core API\nmodular monolith" as Core
rectangle "Exam worker\nasync grading" as Worker
rectangle "Plugin QR process\nHTTP contract" as Plugin
database "Tenant A DB\nrole A only" as DBA
database "Tenant B DB\nrole B only" as DBB
database "Control plane DB\ntenant registry" as Catalog
database "Object storage / CDN\nmaterials, video" as Object
rectangle "Reporting / warning job" as Report
cloud "IdP trường" as IdP
cloud "Plagiarism mock" as Plag
Browser --> Gateway : HTTPS
Gateway --> IdP : OIDC/SAML
Gateway --> Core : HTTPS + verified context
Core --> Catalog : read tenant routing/config
Core --> DBA : SQL, credential A
Core --> DBB : SQL, credential B
Core --> Object : signed URL / metadata
Core --> Plugin : HTTP JSON, timeout
Worker --> DBA : SQL pending receipt
Worker --> DBB : SQL pending receipt
Report --> DBA : read-only SQL
Report --> DBB : read-only SQL
Worker ..> Plag : async HTTPS
legend bottom
  C4 L2: database per tenant, shared compute.
  --> synchronous; ..> asynchronous.
  Cross-DB role permission denied; no plugin DB access.
endlegend
@enduml
